  "notes": [
    "Ten new scenarios run on both actual SQLite and IndexedDB: seven shared contracts plus persistence, migration and a forced abort between archive creation and pending deletion; complete-record matching rejects equal-revision replacement.",
    "Exact account/partition/ID archive lookup has no unbounded scan. Pending limits remain 128 per account and 512 per database; completion evidence is capped at 64 KiB UTF-8.",
    "The same immutable command identity cannot be recreated after archival. Changed request/resource/sort is rejected; identical raw insertion returns AlreadyStored and archive-aware callers must read the retained completion.",
    "Feature authorization, encrypted proof encoding, receipt cleanup and Chat UI remain subsequent integration work. This raw store does not infer an outcome or start delivery."
  ],
